<p style="Heading 1" props="" xid="3">Quarterly Widget Report</p>
<p style="Text body" xid="4">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, <c props="font-style:italic">consectetur</c> adipiscing elit, sed do <c props="font-weight:bold">eiusmod</c> tempor incididunt ut <c props="text-decoration:underline">labore</c> et dolore magna aliqua. Visit the <a xlink:href="https://example.com/widgets" xid="5">widget catalogue</a> for details.</p>
